---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About — GEO China"
			description="GEO China is the AI growth partner for Chinese-speaking B2B teams. Two parallel offerings: a GEO Agent that auto-ships PRs, plus integrated marketing executed via a vetted provider network. Integrity-first."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header lang="en" />
		<main>
			<section class="page-header">
				<div class="section-label"><span class="label-dot"></span> About</div>
				<h1>We don't sell reports.<br/>We ship PRs.</h1>
				<p class="page-desc">
					GEO China is the AI growth partner for Chinese-speaking B2B teams.
					One product line where the Agent auto-ships PRs. One service line where a vetted provider network executes integrated marketing.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="about-grid">
				<div class="about-main">
					<h2>What we solve</h2>
					<p>
						Existing SEO/GEO tools (Ahrefs / SEMrush / Surfer / Frase) stop at "report output."
						<strong>70%+ of paying customers never execute the recommendations</strong> —
						because the gap from "knowing what to fix" to "actually fixed and deployed" is 5+ manual steps.
					</p>
					<p>
						Our Agent closes that loop — it produces <strong>merge-ready PRs</strong>, not another PDF.
						You click Merge, rankings move. This is the only structural advantage a new entrant can claim —
						incumbents are data companies, not engineering teams.
					</p>

					<h2>Why China focus</h2>
					<p>
						China has 5 native AI search engines — <strong>Doubao / Kimi / Yuanbao / Wenxin / Tongyi</strong> —
						with citation logic, schema interpretation, and retrieval behavior fundamentally different from ChatGPT / Perplexity.
						Western tools structurally cannot ship this coverage — no boots in China, no native Chinese GEO signal reading.
					</p>
					<p>
						This is a real moat. We bet that Chinese AI-search visibility will become more, not less, important over the next 2–3 years —
						whether you're a domestic SaaS, a team going overseas, or an overseas brand entering Chinese markets.
					</p>

					<h2>Two parallel offerings</h2>
					<ul class="dual-line">
						<li>
							<span class="dl-tag">Product · SaaS</span>
							<strong>AI Growth Agent</strong>
							<p>Auto-ships merge-ready PRs every week, 9-engine visibility tracking, code stays with you, 30-day refund. $99 / $999 monthly.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="dl-tag gold">Service · Strategy + Provider Matrix</span>
							<strong>Cross-platform Integrated Marketing</strong>
							<p>We do strategy and orchestration; a vetted provider network handles execution — Reddit / X / Xiaohongshu / Zhihu / B站 / 公众号 + offline hacker houses. Honest framing: we don't sit in the Xiaohongshu admin ourselves.</p>
						</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Integrity-first, not lock-in</h2>
					<p>
						<strong>30-day refund · Code stays with you · Cancel anytime</strong> — not a sales line, the architecture itself.
						We only sell what we genuinely believe works. If we can't deliver what a customer needs, we'll say so —
						not stuff features into the contract.
					</p>

					<h2>Contact</h2>
					<p>
						Email: <a href="mailto:hi@geochina.co">hi@geochina.co</a><br/>
						Web: <a href="https://geochina.co">geochina.co</a><br/>
						Try it: <a href="/scan">Free AI Visibility Scan →</a>
					</p>
				</div>

				<aside class="about-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<h3>GEO at a Glance</h3>
						<p>GEO = getting AI search engines to actively cite your content.</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Princeton: GEO lifts AI visibility <strong>+40%</strong></li>
							<li>AI-referred traffic converts at <strong>5×</strong> SEO</li>
							<li>ChatGPT WAU: <strong>800M+</strong></li>
							<li>China AI search WAU (est.): <strong>100M+</strong></li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="sidebar-card sidebar-card-cta">
						<h3>Start with a free scan</h3>
						<p>Run a 9-engine AI visibility report on your site. Free, no signup.</p>
						<a href="/scan" class="sidebar-btn">Free Scan →</a>
					</div>
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<h3>See full services</h3>
						<p>2 product tiers + 4 marketing service lines + 3 consulting offers.</p>
						<a href="/en/services" class="sidebar-link">Services overview →</a>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</section>
			<p class="page-updated">Last updated: May 2026</p>
		</main>
		<Footer lang="en" />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main { width: var(--max-w-wide); max-width: calc(100% - 3em); }
	.page-header { padding: 5em 0 3em; }
	.page-header h1 { margin-top: 0.6em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; font-size: 3.6em; line-height: 1.12; }
	.page-desc { font-size: 1.15em; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 680px; line-height: 1.7; }
	.about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; gap: 4em; padding: 3em 0 5em; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
	.about-main { padding-top: 1em; }
	.about-main h2 { font-size: 1.6em; margin-top: 2.2em; margin-bottom: 0.6em; }
	.about-main h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
	.about-main p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1em; }
	.dual-line { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1em 0 1.5em; display: grid; gap: 1em; }
	.dual-line li { padding: 1.5em; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--bg-soft); }
	.dual-line strong { display: block; font-size: 1.15em; color: var(--black); margin: 0.5em 0; }
	.dual-line p { font-size: 14.5px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
	.dl-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 10px; background: rgba(217, 75, 59, 0.12); color: var(--cta-hover); border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
	.dl-tag.gold { background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.18); color: #8a5a0a; }
	.about-sidebar { padding-top: 1em; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2em; }
	.sidebar-card { background: var(--bg-section); padding: 1.8em; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
	.sidebar-card-cta { background: var(--accent-deep); color: white; }
	.sidebar-card-cta h3, .sidebar-card-cta p { color: white; }
	.sidebar-card-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
	.sidebar-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
	.sidebar-card p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
	.sidebar-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1em 0 0; }
	.sidebar-card li { font-size: 13.5px; padding: 6px 0; color: var(--text-secondary); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
	.sidebar-card li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
	.sidebar-card strong { color: var(--black); }
	.sidebar-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1em; padding: 10px 18px; background: var(--cta); color: white; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: var(--radius); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; }
	.sidebar-btn:hover { background: var(--cta-hover); color: white; }
	.sidebar-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.6em; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
	.page-updated { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 2em 0 0; margin: 0; }
	@media (max-width: 960px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2em; } }
	@media (max-width: 720px) { .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.2em; } }
</style>
